choosing how it repeats
"╭─── Monday, October 5 2026 (today) ───╮"
"│1╭ Repeat ──────────────────────────╮ │"
"│2│ Buy milk                         │ │"
"│ │                                  │ │"
"│ │ w  on days of the week…          │ │"
"│ │ d  every few days…               │ │"
"│ │ m  every few months, on the 5th… │ │"
"│ │                                  │ │"
"│ │ Each time, a copy is added to    │ │"
"│ │ its day, with the same time.     │ │"
"╰─╰─────────── esc cancel ───────────╯─╯"
" REPEAT   j/k move  ↵ choose  esc cancel"

